<h3 style=3D'margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-lef=
t:
0in;line-height:114%;border:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0p=
t;
mso-border-shadow:yes'><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans";
color:#1B1C1D'>The Fourth Rule - Examine all slings and webbing before use,
