mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> Any equipment found to be defective must be immediately rem=
oved
from service. To prevent accidental reuse by uninformed personnel, defective
