style:
normal'>decreases</i>, the tension on the sling <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-s=
tyle:
normal'>increases</i> significantly.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'fo=
nt-size:
12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-fam=
ily:
"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>5=
