Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Controlling the work
area is a fundamental safety requirement. This is achieved by establishing a
formal <b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Exclusion Zone</b>. This is=
 a
