Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Electrostatic Discha=
rge
is the rapid, uncontrolled transfer of static electricity between two objec=
ts.
To a human, it might be an imperceptible event or a tiny spark, but to a
