harge
of only a few volts&#8212;far too small for a person to see or feel&#8212;c=
an
permanently destroy the microscopic internal pathways of integrated circuit=
s,
processors, and control boards.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-si=
ze:12.0pt;
