mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> This is not an optional guideline but a legal requirement. =
The
certification process, such as that administered by the National Commission=
 for
the Certification of Crane Operators (NCCCO), is a rigorous, multi-stage
validation of an operator's capabilities.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN
style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";
