Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>The procedure requir=
es
two operators, each with a lever dolly, to position themselves at opposite
sides or corners of the load.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size=
:12.0pt;
line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"Go=
ogle Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>7</span></sup><span
