Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'> The most critical
safety element is <b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>clear and contin=
uous
communication</b>. Before any action, the operators must agree on a plan and
designate a lead person to give commands such as &quot;lift on three,&quot;
&quot;hold,&quot; or &quot;lower&quot;.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN
style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";
