:normal'>synchronized</b>.
Both operators must apply force and raise their respective sides at the same
rate to keep the load level. Once the load is lifted to the desired height,
other team members can slide transport dollies into place. The load is then
lowered slowly and synchronously onto the dollies, with verbal confirmation=
 at
every step.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

