ogle Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>42</span></sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'> A robot must always=
 be
treated as if it is live until LOTO is personally verified by the worker
