Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>However, simply lock=
ing
out the main power is insufficient. Technicians must also safely dissipate =
any <b
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>stored energy</b> that could remain i=
n the
system. This includes releasing trapped pressure in pneumatic grippers or
hydraulic lines and safely discharging large capacitors within the robot
controller.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-heigh=
t:114%;
font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>45</span></sup><span
