h.
This switch enables robot motion only when it is held in its middle positio=
n.
If the operator releases the switch or squeezes it harder in a panic, the r=
obot
immediately stops. This feature prevents uncontrolled movement if the opera=
tor
is startled or becomes incapacitated.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN
style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#444746'>43</span></sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google =
