Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Automated mobile
platforms represent the convergence of mobility, sensing, and intelligent
control in material handling. <b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Auto=
mated
