mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans";
color:#1B1C1D'>1.1 The Center of Gravity (CoG): The Fulcrum of Every Lift</=
span><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;line-height:114%;color:black'><o:p></o:=
p></span></h3>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:114%;border:=
none;
mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes'><span
