mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'> This is a design-le=
vel
safety feature, a &quot;tell-tale&quot; engineered into the hardware. OSHA
1926.251 then mandates that a competent person must inspect that same block
before each shift and remove it from service if it is defective (i.e., defo=
rmed).</span><sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
