lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>To operate the hoist,
the brake must be actively disengaged. When the operator presses a control
button, an electrical current is sent to the brake's electromagnetic coil. =
