/span><sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#444746'>6</span></sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google S=
ans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> An automated system can place a component with pinpoint
accuracy, assemble a product with unwavering consistency, and transport goo=
ds
with predictable efficiency, all of which reduce costs and improve product
quality.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:1=
14%;
font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>1</span></sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:114%;border:=
none;
