-height:
114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Te=
xt";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>9</span></sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'> Power cables and
pneumatic hoses routed across floors can become tripping hazards.</span><su=
p><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#444746'>9</span></sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google S=
ans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> The operational environment itself may introduce risks, suc=
h as
exposure to chemical fumes from welding robots, excessive noise, or heat fr=
om
machinery.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height=
:114%;
font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#444746'>9</span></sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'> The risk of fire is
also a constant concern, arising not only from electrical faults but also f=
rom
the ignition of flammable materials like hydraulic oil.</span><sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#444746'>11</span></sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google =
Sans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> A comprehensive safety analysis must account for all these
