Sans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> The hoist is a complex mechanical and electrical assembly
containing a powerful motor, a gearbox, a drum, and a system of wire rope or
chain. It is the hoist that performs the vertical lifting and lowering of t=
he
load via a hook attached to the end of the rope or chain.</span><sup><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
