lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Next is the <b
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>wire rope</b>. The operator performs a
