><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sa=
ns Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#444746'>23</span></sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google =
Sans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> They check that the bridge and trolley travel smoothly and =
that
the indicated direction on the controller matches the actual direction of
movement. A crucial test is for the <b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal=
'>hoist
limit switch</b>. The operator will slowly, or &quot;inch,&quot; the empty =
hook
block upwards until it trips the upper limit switch, which should automatic=
ally
stop the hoisting motion to prevent the block from colliding with the troll=
ey.</span><sup><span
