weight. The operator must confirm the precise weight and locate its center =
of
gravity to ensure a stable lift.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-s=
ize:
12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-fam=
ily:
