lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Because the line of
force is direct and uncomplicated by angles, a lift made using a vertical h=
itch
allows the sling to be used at 100% of its rated capacity as specified on i=
ts
identification tag for a vertical lift.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN
style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;line-height:114%;font-family:"Google Sans Text";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-bidi-font-family:"Google San=
s Text";
