color:#1B1C1D'>6.2 Visualizing the Force Multiplier Effect</span><span lang=
=3DEN
style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;line-height:114%;color:black'><o:p></o:p></span><=
/h3>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:12.0pt;line-height:114%;border:=
none;
