he
appropriate tension multiplier for that angle, the actual tension that will=
 be
applied to each sling leg must be calculated. This calculated tension must =
then
be compared to the Working Load Limit (WLL) stated on the sling's
identification tag for that specific type of hitch. The calculated tension =
