plan is unsafe and must be revised. Revisions may include using longer slin=
gs
to create a safer (larger) angle or selecting slings with a higher capacity.
Only when the calculated forces are verified to be safely within the
equipment's rated limits can the lift proceed.</span><span lang=3DEN
style=3D'color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

