s Text";
color:#1B1C1D'> Software is the intelligence that coordinates the interplay
between sensors, controllers, and actuators. It implements the complex logic
for features such as automated speed reduction during turns, collision
detection, and dynamic stability control. Furthermore, it manages the user
interface and enables the integration of the truck into a larger warehouse
management system, allowing for advanced capabilities like conveyor tracking
and automated dispatch.</span><sup><span lang=3DEN style=3D'font-size:12.0p=
t;
