braking. This demonstrates that there is no &quot;one-size-fits-all&quot;
mechatronic solution in material handling; rather, the design is driven by =
the
unique physics and operational constraints of the task at hand.</span><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

