mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes'><span
lang=3DEN style=3D'font-family:"Google Sans Text";mso-fareast-font-family:"=
Google Sans Text";
mso-bidi-font-family:"Google Sans Text";color:#1B1C1D'>Before the inspection
begins, a safe and controlled environment must be established. The forklift
should be parked on a level surface in a well-lit area, clear of traffic and
workplace activity. The key must be removed from the ignition, the parking =
brake
